========================================================================================================
EXPOSURE — value-weighted measurement over decisions already made
========================================================================================================

  Nothing here is tuned. Every decision, answer and trigger is read verbatim
  from the controller's audit records; this only re-weights them by money.

  EXPOSURE DEFINITION
    wrongly auto-closed : the FULL absolute B amount. A wrong answer was posted
                          and nobody will look at it, so the whole transaction
                          value is exposed — not a difference between candidates.
    escalated           : the FULL absolute B amount, at risk pending review.
                          This INCLUDES rows whose correct answer is blank: until
                          a reviewer confirms nothing should have matched, the
                          amount is unresolved.
    correctly auto-closed: contributes nothing to exposure; counted only in the
                          denominator of value-weighted precision.

    Escalated exposure is WORKLOAD (value awaiting a human). Wrongly auto-closed
    exposure is value already out the door unchecked. Do not add them together.

