  value auto-closed INCORRECTLY  (exposure)                   13.83B   (1.106% of batch)
  value in the exception queue   (at risk)                    83.61B   (6.687% of batch)

  rows auto-closed incorrectly                                   472
  mean value of a wrongly auto-closed row                     29.30M
  mean value of a correctly auto-closed row                   40.53M
  mean value of an escalated row                              26.69M

  Value-weighted precision is 0.447 points BETTER than row-count precision.
  Errors fall disproportionately on smaller amounts.

